**Shared core (`commonMain/auth/`):** pure-Kotlin SHA-256 + base64url (`AuthCrypto`), PKCE S256 verifier/challenge + authorize-URL builder + strict redirect validation (`Pkce`), `OidcConfig`, `TokenSet`/`TokenGrant`, `AuthState` StateFlow, `AuthBrowser` seam + `AuthException`, `SecureTokenStore` interface, a form-encoded `KtorTokenEndpointClient`, and the `AuthService` orchestrator (single-flight refresh under a shared mutex, persist-before-memory, `invalid_grant` vs transient handling, `asTokenProvider()` wiring into the S4 seam).

